LightningMagic: {
	DisplayName: Lightning Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to create swift bolts of destructive lightning
}

IceMagic: {
	DisplayName: Ice Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to generate cold hard ice which can freeze and chill to the blood and bone
}

MagmaMagic: {
	DisplayName: Magma Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to unleash eruptions of thick, molten rock that melts all in its path
}

WindMagic: {
	DisplayName: Wind Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to send turbulent gales that whirl enemies into tumultuous peril
}

AcidMagic: {
	DisplayName: Acid Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to form a caustic, reactive liquid that corrodes through enemies
}

AshMagic: {
	DisplayName: Ash Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to shroud the air with smoldering cinders, preserving the most ill-fated as ashen statues
}

CrystalMagic: {
	DisplayName: Crystal Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to materialize luminous crystals which embed themselves in adversaries and brilliantly shatter after high accumulation
}

EarthMagic: {
	DisplayName: Earth Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to generate solid rock to crush enemies under giant boulders and earthen pillars
}

ExplosionMagic: {
	DisplayName: Explosion Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to wreak havoc with massive explosions, leaving any remains singed from combustion
}

FireMagic: {
	DisplayName: Fire Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to cast fearsome flames, engulfing enemies in a roaring blaze
}

GlassMagic: {
	DisplayName: Glass Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to generate elegant ornaments of glass that can shatter into knife-like shards to keep danger at bay
}

LightMagic: {
	DisplayName: Light Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to overwhelm foes with shining light moving at incredible speeds and blinding anyone struck
}

MetalMagic: {
	DisplayName: Metal Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to form dense metals that demolish obstructions with their immense weight and force
}

PlasmaMagic: {
	DisplayName: Plasma Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to cast fervent plasma that swiftly scorches rivals with coruscating heat
}

PoisonMagic: {
	DisplayName: Poison Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to form noxious fumes which inflict chronic poisons and leave lethal clouds of gas
}

SandMagic: {
	DisplayName: Sand Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to create densely-packed sand that hits with treacherous force while hindering sight
}

ShadowMagic: {
	DisplayName: Shadow Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to evoke ominous dark shadows that drain color and grace from all that they touch
}

SnowMagic: {
	DisplayName: Snow Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to form wintry snow, snuffing out heat and sight under chilly layers
}

WaterMagic: {
	DisplayName: Water Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to utilize water's vast potential to rinse foes with tidal forces
}

WoodMagic: {
	DisplayName: Wood Magic
	Tooltip: Allows the user to slam foes with solid wood and bark, becoming even stronger when exposed to heat
}

